      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Was all hassle free from initial sales inquiry to the completed install.  We got a few quotes and one did not leave ANY paperwork to evaluate once salesperson had left - 4shore were the opposite with brochures and facts and figures.  Grant answered all our questions.  Then as we took our time in making decision they did not \"hound\" us.  Once we made our decision the system was installed within  a couple of weeks.The installation was not straight forward as there was one specific requirement that was not negotiable.  This was discussed with installation supervisor who met the request, then the rest of he install went ahead without problem.4shore Solar was not the cheapest but we chose to run with them as the reviews on the cheaper system suppliers were not favorable, particularly with regard to deliver (Install) delays.",
